.TH SDL_HINT_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_WARP 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_WARP \- A variable controlling whether to use the Direct3D 11 WARP software rasterizer.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_WARP \(dqSDL_RENDER_DIRECT3D11_WARP\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
For more information, see: https://learn\[char46]microsoft\[char46]com/en-us/windows/win32/direct3darticles/directx-warp
.PP
The variable can be set to the following values:
.PP

\(bu \(dq0\(dq: Disable WARP rasterizer\[char46] (default)
.PP
\(bu \(dq1\(dq: Enable WARP rasterizer\[char46]
.PP
This hint should be set before creating a renderer\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This hint is available since SDL 3\[char46]4\[char46]0\[char46]

